import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 936 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 2 | The No-Consumption-of-Stock Iron Law","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 936 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 2 | The No-Consumption-of-Stock Iron Law","no":936,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 2","Stock Protection","Anti-Predation","Causal Self-Discipline"],"related":["25-Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism","04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","935-Increment-Development Iron Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0936_模块5-规则二-不消耗存量铁律.md","filePath":"en/0936_模块5-规则二-不消耗存量铁律.md"}'),n={name:"en/0936_模块5-规则二-不消耗存量铁律.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,u,h){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-936-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-2-the-no-consumption-of-stock-iron-law" tabindex="-1">Entry 936 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 2 | The No-Consumption-of-Stock Iron Law <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-936-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-2-the-no-consumption-of-stock-iron-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 936 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 2 | The No-Consumption-of-Stock Iron Law&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 25, 04 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-what-already-belongs-to-someone-not-an-inch-may-move" tabindex="-1">Introduction: what already belongs to someone, not an inch may move <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-what-already-belongs-to-someone-not-an-inch-may-move" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: what already belongs to someone, not an inch may move&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Rule 1 says &quot;power must come from new creation&quot;; Rule 2 immediately adds the other half — &quot;what others already have, not an inch may move.&quot; The Increment-Development Iron Law and the No-Consumption-of-Stock Iron Law are two sides of one coin: the former governs source legitimacy; the latter governs boundary sacredness. The old cosmos&#39;s countless tragedies were precisely not from lacking increments, but from the strong not even sparing stock: devouring others&#39; cultivation, refining living souls, treating a planet as cultivation fuel. Heavenly-Dao Rule 2 must thoroughly seal this kind of &quot;even grabbing the rice in the pot&quot; behavior at the cosmic-law layer.</p><p>The six top-level axioms run through it: the anti-predation axiom directly negates the old logic that &quot;consuming stock is evolution&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races declares each being&#39;s established achievements are his inalienable evolutionary assets; the collective-ascension axiom requires stock not only not be consumed, but be protected and transmitted; the causal self-discipline axiom writes &quot;not touching others&#39; stock&quot; as a hard boundary of cross-plane interference; the law-first axiom lets &quot;stock&quot; &#39;s ownership, measurement, and disputes be adjudicated first by law, not by fist size.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-the-stock-list-and-no-touch-clauses" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: The Stock List and No-Touch Clauses <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-the-stock-list-and-no-touch-clauses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: The Stock List and No-Touch Clauses&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The No-Consumption-of-Stock Iron Law stipulates:</p><ol><li>All beings&#39; already-cultivated cultivation, already-comprehended laws, already-accumulated memory and soul-spirit are regarded as their &quot;non-consumable stock&quot;;</li><li>All planet consciousnesses, civilizational communities, and clan lineages&#39; multi-generational accumulated achievements are regarded as &quot;collective stock,&quot; equally protected;</li><li>No cultivation method, formation, treasure, or realm advancement may take &quot;sacrificing others,&quot; &quot;refining soul-spirits,&quot; or &quot;devouring origin&quot; as energy source or cost;</li><li>Allowed exchange is limited to mutual-benefit cooperation of &quot;increment for increment&quot;; stock may transfer only under the owner&#39;s complete voluntariness and without harming third parties, and transfer must leave a trace in the Alaya Network.</li></ol><p>In one sentence: stock may be studied, researched, and praised, but may not be eaten, drained, or taken away.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis-why-stock-is-sacred" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis: Why Stock Is Sacred <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis-why-stock-is-sacred" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis: Why Stock Is Sacred&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This rule&#39;s jurisprudence is more than moral; it has three hard arguments:</p><ul><li><strong>Feedback-cycle argument</strong>: the Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism (Document 25) proves power gained by consuming stock is doubly backlashed in the causal loop — the stronger the predator, the fiercer the backlash; this is precisely the mechanism root of predatory systems&#39; inevitable historical regression;</li><li><strong>Self-growth argument</strong>: the Self-Growing Evolution Law (Document 07) points out each being&#39;s stock is the crystal of years of self-growth; forcibly draining it equals breaking his causal trunk, causing irreparable origin incompleteness;</li><li><strong>Civilizational-continuity argument</strong>: once collective stock (civilizational classics, planetary ecology, clan gifts) is consumed, later Myriad Ranks have no chance to stand on predecessors&#39; shoulders, and civilization necessarily breaks across generations.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism-how-stock-is-guarded" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism: How Stock Is Guarded <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism-how-stock-is-guarded" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism: How Stock Is Guarded&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network builds a &quot;stock archive&quot; for every being and every civilization, marking the causal ownership of their cultivation, soul-spirit, and memory;</li><li>All cultivation energy input must pass a &quot;stock-verification gate&quot;: if the energy&#39;s source traces to some stock subject, it is automatically rejected and alerted;</li><li>Voluntary transfer has triple protection: owner&#39;s soul-spirit confirmation, no minor/unconscious being harmed, Symbiotic Court online witness;</li><li>The Quest Sediment Domain retains &quot;predation-scenario simulation,&quot; letting cultivators intuitively see the long-term causal bill of consuming stock, eradicating motivation cognitively.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: carelessly touching others&#39; stock (e.g., a cultivation method inadvertently absorbing a neighbor&#39;s dissipated energy), forced stripping, equal compensation, one inner-demon record;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: designing &quot;pseudo-voluntary&quot; contracts, using illusions to lure others into yielding stock, has law-anchor permissions stripped and enters Entry 960&#39;s conversion program;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: those taking devouring, refining, and sacrifice as routine cultivation means are recidivist predatory cultivators, handled specially under Rule 25 (Entry 959).</li></ul><p>Sanction&#39;s core is &quot;restore stock ownership,&quot; not simple annihilation — the consumed stock energy, after causal retrogression, must as much as possible be returned to the original owner or his civilizational community.</p><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision is the first line: the stock-verification gate automatically rejects as the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee spot-checks &quot;voluntary transfer&quot; authenticity as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court accepts stock-ownership disputes as the third layer; each clan&#39;s autonomy assembly exercises protection over its own collective stock as the fourth layer. Rule 2 especially authorizes weak clans, plant spirits, and planet consciousness to directly sue the strong, with no &quot;station too low to sue&quot; threshold.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: avoiding civilizational-level energy idling from &quot;kill-or-be-killed&quot; zero-sum games</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: writing &quot;no consuming stock&quot; as cosmic hard law; predators&#39; energy channels to act are sealed; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in Tang-Luo-type systems the weak are the strong&#39;s &quot;stock batteries,&quot;随时可取; in Heng Yuan Zhou the weak&#39;s stock is Heavenly-Dao protected, and the strong reaching out is unconstitutional</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the protected object applies uniformly from the human race to planet consciousness, plant spirits, and consciousness-information clans, with no station discrimination</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated cross-plane civilizations&#39; stock automatically enters the protection list, not regarded as ownerless because they have &quot;not yet submitted&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Stock is the road Myriad Ranks each have walked. Rule 2 declares: no one has the right to eat the road others have walked as his own. With stock held, Myriad-Rank republicanism has a true &quot;every person&quot; to speak of.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/935_模块5-规则一-增量开发铁律.html">Entry 935 · Rule 1 Increment-Development Iron Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/959_模块5-规则二十五-掠夺式修炼禁止.html">Entry 959 · Rule 25 Predatory Cultivation Prohibited</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const p=t(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
